                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">ZCLAttributeInfo</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
This interface provides information about the attribute, like its ZCL
 attribute ID, if it manufacturer specific and about its data type (see
 {@link #getDataType}).
   </fo:block>
