                                 <fo:block>frame</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>The frame containing the command to issue.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>exportedServicePID</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>: the source endpoint of the command request.
        In targeted situations, the source endpoint is the valid service
        PID of an exported endpoint.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Invokes a command on this cluster. This method is to be used by
 applications when the targeted device has to distinguish between source
 endpoints of the message. For instance, alarms cluster (see 3.11 Alarms
 Cluster in [ZCL]) generated events are differently interpreted if they
 come from the oven or from the intrusion alert system.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A promise representing the completion of this asynchronous call.
         {@link Promise#getValue()} returns the response {@link ZCLFrame}.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCluster.readAttributes-ZCLAttributeInfo---">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.5.12</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract Promise&lt;Map&lt;Integer, ZCLReadStatusRecord&gt;&gt; readAttributes(ZCLAttributeInfo[][] attributes)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>attributes</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>An array of {@link ZCLAttributeInfo}.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Reads a list of attributes by issuing a ZCL Read Attributes command. The
 attribute list is provided in terms of an array of
 {@link ZCLAttributeInfo} objects.
 
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 As described in section <fo:inline font-style="italic">2.4.1.3 Effect on Receipt</fo:inline> of the ZCL
 specification, a <fo:inline font-style="italic">Read Attributes</fo:inline> command results in a list of
 attribute status records comprising a mix of successful and unsuccessful
 attribute reads.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The method returns a promise. The object used to resolve the
 {@link Promise} is a {@code Map&lt;Integer,
 ZCLReadStatusRecord&gt;}. For each Map entry, the key contains the attribute
 identifier and the value, a ZigBee Read Attributes Status Record, which
 is made of the status of the read of this attribute, the ZigBee data type
 of the attribute and the attribute value in the corresponding Java
 wrapper type (or null in case of an unsupported attribute or in case of
 an invalid value). For attributes which data type serialization is not
 supported (that is, {@link ZCLDataTypeDescription#getJavaDataType()}
 returns null), the value is of type byte[].
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 When the list of attributes do not fit into a single ZCLFrame, ZigBee
 clusters truncate the list of attributes returned in the response. The
 client has to check the Map of results to send a new request for the
 attributes which values are missing. In export situations, the base
 driver may truncate the read attribute command response sent to networked
 devices in order to obey the rules.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
                     <fo:inline font-weight="bold">NOTE:</fo:inline> According to the ZigBee Specification all the attributes
 must be standard attributes or belong to the same manufacturer code,
 otherwise the promise must fail with a {@link IllegalArgumentException}
 exception.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A promise representing the completion of this asynchronous call.
         The promise may fail with an {@link IllegalArgumentException} if
         the array size is 0 or if one of the array entries is
         {@code null} or not valid. An {@link IllegalArgumentException} is
         also thrown if some of {@link ZCLAttributeInfo} are manufacturer
         specific and other are standard, or even if there are mix of
         attributes with different manufacturer specific code. If the
         passed argument is {@code null} the promise must fail with a
         {@code NullPointerException}.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCluster.writeAttributes-boolean-Map-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.5.13</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract Promise&lt;Map&lt;Integer, Integer&gt;&gt; writeAttributes(boolean undivided, Map&lt;? extends ZCLAttributeInfo, ?&gt; attributesAndValues)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>undivided</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>{@code true} if an undivided write attributes command is
        requested, {@code false} if not.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>attributesAndValues</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A {@code Map&lt;ZCLAttributeInfo, Object&gt;} of
        attributes and values to be written. For ZCLAttributeInfo objects
        which serialization is not supported (that is,
        {@code getDataType().getJavaDataType()} returns null), the value
        must be of type byte[].</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Writes a set of attributes on the cluster using the ZCL <fo:inline font-style="italic">Write
 Attributes</fo:inline> or the <fo:inline font-style="italic">Write Attributes Undivided</fo:inline> commands,
 according to the passed {@code undivided} parameter.
 
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The promise resolves with a {@code Map&lt;Integer, Integer&gt;}. If all the
 attributes have been written successfully, the map is empty. In case of
 failure in writing specific attribute(s), the map is filled with entries
 related to those attributes. Every key is set with the id of an attribute
 that was not written successfully, every value with the status returned
 in the associated <fo:inline font-style="italic">write attribute response record</fo:inline> accordingly
 re-mapped to one of the constants defined in the {@link ZCLException}
 class.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 According to the ZigBee Specification all the attributes must be standard
 attributes or, if manufacturer-specific they must have the same
 manufacturer code, otherwise an {@link IllegalArgumentException} occurs.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A promise representing the completion of this asynchronous call.
         If resolved successfully the promise may return an empty {@code 
         Map&lt;Integer, Integer&gt;}. Otherwise the map will be filled with the
         status information about the attributes that were not written.
         The key represents the attributeID and the value the status
         present in the corresponding attribute record returned by the ZCL
         Write Attributes response message. The original ZCL status values
         must be re-mapped to the list of status values listed in the
         {@link ZCLException} class. The promise may fail with an
         {@link IllegalArgumentException} if some of
         {@link ZCLAttributeInfo} are manufacturer specific and other are
         standard, or even if there are mix of attributes with different
         manufacturer specific code.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponse">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>149.31.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract ZCLCommandResponse</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
A response event for a {@link ZCLCommandResponseStream}.
   </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponse.getResponse--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.6.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract Promise&lt;ZCLFrame&gt; getResponse()</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Returns a promise holding the response.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A Promise holding the {@link ZCLFrame} response, or a failure
         exception if this is not a success response.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponse.isEnd--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
