            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponseStream">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>149.31.7</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract ZCLCommandResponseStream</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
This type represents a stream of responses to a broadcast operation. It can
 be closed by the client using the {@link #close} method is called.
 
 The {@link ZCLCommandResponseStream} is used to process a stream of responses
 from a ZigBee network. Responses are consumed by registering a handler with
 {@link #forEach(Predicate)}. Responses received before a handler is
 registered are buffered until a handler is registered, or until the close
 method is called.
 
 A handler consumes events returning <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> to continue delivery.
 At some point the ZigBee service invocation will terminate event delivery by
 sending a close event (a {@link ZCLCommandResponse} which returns
 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> from {@link ZCLCommandResponse#isEnd()}. After a close
 event the handler function will be dereferenced.
   </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponseStream.close--">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.7.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void close()</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Closes this response, indicating that no further responses are needed.
 
 Any buffered responses will be discarded, and a close event will be sent
 to a handler if it is registered.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZCLCommandResponseStream.forEach-Predicate-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.7.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract void forEach(Predicate&lt;? super ZCLCommandResponse&gt; handler)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>handler</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A handler to process ZCLCommandResponse objects</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Registers a handler that will be called for each of the received
 responses. Only one handler may be registered. Any responses that arrive
 before a handler is registered will be buffered and pushed into the
 handler when it is registered.
 
 If the handler returns <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">false</fo:inline> from its accept method then the
 handler will be released and no further events will be delivered. Any
 remaining buffered events will be discarded, and this object marked as
 closed.
 
 If the handler does not close the stream early then the ZigBee service
 implementation will eventually send a close event.
   </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Throws</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">IllegalStateException</fo:inline>– if a handler has already been registered,
         or if this object has been closed (a {@link ZCLCommandResponse}
         which returns <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> from
         {@link ZCLCommandResponse#isEnd()}. After a close event the
         handler function will be dereferenced.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
