                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.18.44</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final short SIGNED_INTEGER_8 = 224</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
According to ZigBee Cluster Library [1], the Signed Integer type
 represents a signed integer with a decimal range of -(2^7-1) to 2^7-1, -
 (2^15-1) to 2^15-1, -(2^23-1) to 2^23-1, -(2^31-1) to 2^31-1, -(2^39-1)
 to 2^39-1, -(2^47-1) to 2^47-1, -(2^55-1) to 2^55-1, or -(2^63-1) to
 2^63-1, depending on its length. The values that represents an invalid
 value of this type are 0x80, 0x8000, 0x800000, 0x80000000, 0x8000000000,
 0x800000000000, 0x80000000000000 and 0x8000000000000000 respectively.
 This type is defined with several sizes: 8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, 56 and 64
 bits.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeDataTypes.STRUCTURE">
