                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
This interface represents a ZigBee EndPoint.
 
 A ZigBeeEndpoint must be registered as a OSGi service with
 ZigBeeNode.IEEE_ADDRESS, and ZigBeeEndpoint.ENDPOINT_ID properties.
   </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeEndpoint.DEVICE_CATEGORY">
