         is {@link #UNKNOWN_ERROR} and the {@link #hasZigBeeErrorCode()}
         returns {@code true} then the {@link #getZigBeeErrorCode()}
         provides the actual ZigBee error code returned by the device.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
