                              <fo:block>the relationship between {@link ZigBeeNode} returning this LQI
         and the {@link ZigBeeNode} identified by the
         {@link #getNeighbor()}.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeNode">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>149.31.25</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>public abstract ZigBeeNode</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
This interface represents a ZigBee node, means a physical device that can
 communicate using the ZigBee protocol.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Each physical device may contain up 240 logical devices which are represented
 by the {@link ZigBeeEndpoint} class.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Each logical device is identified by an <fo:inline font-style="italic">EndPoint</fo:inline> address, but shares:
 </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d1850e3941">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1850e3942">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>either the <fo:inline font-style="italic">64-bit 802.15.4 IEEE Address</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d1850e3947">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>or the <fo:inline font-style="italic">16-bit ZigBee Network Address</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         relative-align="baseline">
                  <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                     <fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                           <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                              <fo:block>No Implement</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>Consumers of this API must not implement this interface</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeNode.COORDINATOR">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
