                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
ZigBee power source, that is, 3rd bit of "MAC Capabilities" in Node
 Descriptor. Set to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> if the current power source is mains
 power, set to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">false</fo:inline>, otherwise.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This property is of type {@link Boolean}.</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeNode.RECEIVER_ON_WHEN_IDLE">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.25.8</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final String RECEIVER_ON_WHEN_IDLE = "zigbee.node.receiver.on.when.idle"</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
ZigBee receiver on when idle, that is, 4th bit of "MAC Capabilities" in
 Node Descriptor. Set to <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">true</fo:inline> if the device does not
 disable its receiver to conserve power during idle periods, set to
 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">false</fo:inline> otherwise.
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This property is of type {@link Boolean}.</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.ZigBeeNode.ROUTER">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.31.25.9</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final short ROUTER = 3</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
