                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Retrieves the ZigBee node Node Descriptor.
 
 As described in <fo:inline font-style="italic">Table 2.91 Fields of the Node_Desc_rsp Command</fo:inline>
 of the ZigBee specification, a <fo:inline font-style="italic">Node_Desc_rsp</fo:inline> command can return
 with the following status codes:
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
