                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
This interface represents a ZigBee Device description Set. A Set is
 registered as an OSGi Service that provides method to retrieve endpoint
 descriptions.
 
 In addition to the ZigBeeDeviceDescriptionSet's (OSGi service) properties;
 ZigBeeDeviceDescriptionSet is also expected to be registered as an OSGi
 service with the following {@link ZigBeeEndpoint#PROFILE_ID}, and
 {@link ZigBeeNode#MANUFACTURER_CODE} properties.
   </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.zigbee.descriptions.ZigBeeDeviceDescriptionSet.DEVICES">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>149.32.10.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public static final String DEVICES = "zigbee.profile.devices"</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Property key for a comma separated list of devices identifiers supported
 by the set.
 
 This property is <fo:inline font-weight="bold">mandatory</fo:inline>.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
