                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Property key for a version of the application profile. The format is
 'major.minor' with major and minor being integers.
 
 This property is <fo:inline font-weight="bold">mandatory</fo:inline>.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
