               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
This interface represents a Node Descriptor as described in the ZigBee
 Specification.
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The Node Descriptor contains information about the capabilities of the node.</fo:block>
